    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you mean well but it doesn't feel like a lie. it feels like physics. like, if the foundation is cracked, the whole house is gonna fall eventually. i look at them and i just see the future. it's exhausting thinking about how much damage i'm probably gonna cause to the people i love once i finally snap like they did.",
