      "content": "sometimes i think the only way to actually stop it is to make sure it doesn't pass to the next person. like, if i'm the one who breaks the chain, then maybe eventually the cycle actually stops. if i go, the \"bad blood\" doesn't go anywhere else. it just ends with me. doesn't that sound almost... better than just waiting to become them?",
